<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02 · 室外观察者视角 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Person C's Viewpoint)：显露、查明、算出与出版</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>86 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.2 §7.4.3 Figure 2.5)：</b>现在切换为站在屋外的观察者 Person C（<i>She's come out</i>）——从室外观察者 C 的视角看，<b>OUT 意味着「原本躲在封闭容器内看不见的事物，走了出来，变得公开、可见、可理解（In the open / Not hidden / Understandable）」</b>！正如拉丁前缀 <i>ex-plain</i>（展平使字迹可见）一样，把隐藏的真相查明算出（<i>find/figure/work/point out</i>）、秘密泄露（<i>let/leak out</i>）、新书出版面世（<i>come/bring out</i>）全源于此视角。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>work <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>1/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [elaborate] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>come up with</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>elaborate, develop</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>His colleagues <b>worked</b> <b>out</b> his interesting idea.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>We worked up an ad for our client.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>work <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>2/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: happen)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>happen in a certain way, leading to, producing, or resulting in a certain outcome, often well</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>happen</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Things <b>worked</b> <b>out</b> in an interesting way.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>Not everything <b>worked</b> <b>out</b> in the end and we were disappointed.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 12 个核心义项'>1/12</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: prove)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be shown or be found to be</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>prove</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>She proved to be right.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The medicine <b>turned</b> <b>out</b> to save her life.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>She turned up HIV positive.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>work <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>3/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [exercise] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>do physical exercise</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>exercise</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>She <b>works</b> <b>out</b> in the gym every day.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 12 个核心义项'>2/12</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [produce] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>produce quickly or regularly, usually with machinery</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>produce, create</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>This factory <b>turns</b> <b>out</b> saws.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 12 个核心义项'>3/12</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: hap)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>prove to be in the result or end</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>hap</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>It <b>turns</b> <b>out</b> that he was right.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>work <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>4/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: solve)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>find the solution to (a problem or question) or understand the meaning of</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>solve, lick</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Did you solve the problem?</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span><b>Work</b> <b>out</b> your problems with the boss.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>This unpleasant situation isn't going to <b>work</b> itself <b>out</b>.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>work <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>5/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [calculate] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>make a mathematical calculation or computation</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>calculate, cipher</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>They decided to <b>work</b> it <b>out</b> right away.</div></div></div></td></tr>
