<details class='sub-section' id='sub_2'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>03 · 中心向四周发散：分发、广播、呼喊与凸显 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Radiation from Center — EPE Ch.2 §7.2.2 Fig.2.3</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>38 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.2 §7.2.2 Figure 2.3)：</b>就像阳光从太阳中心向四周放射、车轮辐条从轴心向外延伸一样，OUT 表示<b>「从中心点向四周所有方向发散（In all directions away from a central Landmark）」</b>。因此，把传单或物资从发件人手中分发给众人（<i>hand/pass/give/dole/parcel out</i>）、声音从胸腔向外大声喊出（<i>speak/cry/shout/call out</i>）、以及物体从平面向外突出（<i>stand/stick/jut out</i>）均用 OUT。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>call <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [exclaim] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>utter aloud; often with surprise, horror, or joy</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>exclaim, cry</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>`I won!' he exclaimed.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>`Help!' she cried.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>`I'm here,' the mother shouted when she saw her child looking lost.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>send <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>to cause or order to be taken, directed, or transmitted to another place</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>send, transmit</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>He had sent the dispatches downtown to the proper people and had slept.</div></div></div></td></tr>
