<details class='sub-section' id='sub_3'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>04 · 突破原边界延展：铺开、膨胀、坚持到底与彻底执行 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Extension & Beginning-to-End — EPE Ch.2 §7.3.1-7.3.2</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>65 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.2 §7.3.1–7.3.2)：</b>像融化的黄油在锅里向外摊开（<i>spread out</i>），或者把一卷纸彻底展开到尽头（<i>roll out</i>），OUT 表示<b>「体积/面积向外扩张，或事件从头持续延伸到最后一刻（From the beginning to the end）」</b>。因此，脸庞长胖丰满（<i>fill out</i>）、决斗到底（<i>fight it out</i>）、膝盖撑到比赛结束（<i>hold/stick it out</i>）、把计划从头到尾彻底执行完毕（<i>carry out</i>）都属于这一完结体图式。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>carry <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [implement] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>pursue to a conclusion or bring to a successful issue</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>implement, accomplish</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Did he go through with the treatment?</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>He implemented a new economic plan.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>She followed up his recommendations with a written proposal.</div></div></div></td></tr>
