<details class='sub-section' id='sub_4'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>05 · 当事人视角 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Person A's Viewpoint)：脱离空间、出局、爆发与耗尽供应</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>55 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.2 §7.2.1 & §7.4.4)：</b>从跨越边界的当事人 Person A 视角看：① <b>物理逃出或越界爆发</b>：从受限空间冲出（<i>get/walk/break/lash out</i>）；② <b>脱离“拥有某物的状态空间”</b>：EPE 指出英语将“拥有某物”视为一个容器空间（如 <i>We're in the money</i>），一旦走出该空间（<i>run out of time/money</i>, <i>cheat sb out of money</i>），即表示丧失供应或被骗走财物。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
