<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>burst <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>3/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [erupt] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>erupt or intensify suddenly</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>erupt, irrupt</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Unrest erupted in the country.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>Tempers flared at the meeting.</div></div>
